                                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                                      "content": "The graphics driver no longer reads and writes every render target in full for every part of a frame when it doesn't have to. That saves roughly 0.6 to 1 GB of memory traffic per frame in busy scenes. It helps most on M1, M2 and M3 Macs with high shadow quality or anti-aliasing. The game looks exactly the same.",
