                                                      "name": "p",
                                                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                                      "content": "With Settings > Troubleshooting > Debug Logging on, the log now records frame times, slow frames and shader compiles once a second, and Collect Logs… adds a short summary of your last game session. Leave Debug Logging off unless you're reporting a problem: it costs a little performance.",
