                                          "fill": "$text-secondary",
                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "content": "After updating, open SWTOR on Mac and click Update to 0.0.6 in the window (with the game closed), as after every update, so the game uses the new graphics driver.",
                                          "lineHeight": 1.7,
                                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                                          "fontSize": 15,
                                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "type": "text",
                                          "id": "FVeSs",
                                          "name": "p",
                                          "fill": "$text-secondary",
                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "content": "The compiled-shader cache is kept, so there should be no extra stutter after the update. If the first few minutes in a new area do stutter, the cache is being rebuilt; that settles by itself.",
                                          "lineHeight": 1.7,
                                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                                          "fontSize": 15,
                                          "fontWeight": "normal"
